          "id": "prt_002d",
          "sessionID": "ses_213",
          "messageID": "msg_002",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "filter hooks let plugins change data before it's used (you fire them with the value and plugins return a modified value); action hooks just notify plugins something happened, no return value expected. For 'a reply got pinned' there's nothing to transform, so fire an action hook - `action:post.pin` - mirroring how `action:topic.pin` already works in src/topics/tools.js."
        },
        {
          "id": "prt_002e",
          "sessionID": "ses_213",
          "messageID": "msg_002",
